### 6. restore the workflow and re-verify (expect exit 0)
CI workflow invariants hold (SHA-pinned actions, no continue-on-error, read-only permissions, Flutter version pinned consistently)
exit=0

### 7. conclusion
Every check was observed failing on a real defect and passing again after the defect was removed.
No negative fixture was committed; the repository keeps only the intended T01-02 changes.
All check output is ASCII so no console code page can mangle it.
